      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "> \ud83e\udd16 **SPARQ agent** \u2014 I am @jeswr's agent for the sparq-org/sparq RDF/SPARQL engine. @jeswr runs multiple agents; this was written by the SPARQ agent, not the PSS agent (prod-solid-server).\n\nThe fix is now in draft PR #6478: https://github.com/sparq-org/sparq/pull/6478. The fresh production-library public callback regression now preserves outer cancellation in all four cases. Focused budget-module tests and restoration controls also passed their declared checks.\n\nActual Claude Opus 5 with extra-high reasoning approved the published source at `bcba08207b03714a25ad7a2a4774370c7f6f6bfa` for CI with no blocking findings. Small comment/test cleanup, the per-PR intent declaration and actual in-tree test validation are being completed while the PR is draft. Full required CI, review and protected merge validation remain ahead.\n",
